  "prefLabel": "Pdab 202.01 Proceedings Before the Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pdab 202.01 Proceedings Before the Board.\n\n(a) In any proceeding before the board, all motions, requests, and actions shall be conducted pursuant to RSA 541-A:31 through 38.\n\n(b) Proceedings shall be conducted in person.\n\nSource. #13500-A, eff 12-2-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pdab100-300.html"
